{
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "startup|resume|clear",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/session-start-context.sh inicio",
            "statusMessage": "Chequeando cerebro (memorias + .env.local)..."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "compact",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/session-start-context.sh compact",
            "statusMessage": "Reinyectando nucleo post-compact..."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "_comentario": "Los 14 guardianes corren dentro de _dispatcher.sh, que arranca UN node con scripts/_lib/guardianes.mjs (desde 05/09/2026; antes cada guardian era un bash aparte: medido 2.600-3.500 ms por comando con la maquina tranquila, 6-12 s con otras sesiones; ahora ~550 ms). La matriz tool->guardian vive en guardianes.mjs (file-guard/causas solo Edit|Write; supabase/validator/renumber/push/arb/script-inline solo Bash|PowerShell; el resto en los cuatro). Los recordatorios 1x/h salen como additionalContext con exit 0, ya no bloquean. Cada *-guard.sh es un wrapper que sigue andando suelto (asi lo usan sus tests). Tests: _dispatcher.test.sh, guardianes.test.mjs, hooksTienenTest.test.mjs.",
        "matcher": "Bash|PowerShell|Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/_dispatcher.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "mcp__.*__(execute_sql|apply_migration)",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/mcp-write-gate.sh"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/supabase-write-flag.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "SendMessage|Agent|Task|mcp__ccd_session_mgmt__send_message|mcp__ccd_session__spawn_task|mcp__scheduled-tasks__create_scheduled_task",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/coordinador-guard.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_comentario": "04/09/2026: recordatorio NO bloqueante (additionalContext) en el momento exacto de preguntar. 37 AskUserQuestion en 2 semanas, 14 contestadas con fastidio o ya-te-lo-dije.",
        "matcher": "AskUserQuestion",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/pregunta-guard.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/dev-server-guard.sh"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/cierre-guard.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "permissions": {
    "defaultMode": "plan"
  }
}
